{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-practice-34","level":"A2","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Wo? Wohin?","bn":"কোথায় আছে? কোথায় যায়?"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Schlüssel liegt auf ___ Sofa.","options":["dem","das","der"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich lege den Schlüssel auf ___ Sofa.","options":["der","das","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Uhr hängt an ___ Wand.","options":["die","den","der"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ: die → der।","id":"a2-practice-34-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen heute ___ Theater.","options":["ins","im","in dem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? in + das = ins।","id":"a2-practice-34-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wohin? প্রশ্নের উত্তরে কোন case?","options":["Nominativ","Akkusativ","Dativ"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-34-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Bus wartet ___ der Schule. (সামনে)","options":["hinter","über","vor"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-34-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„hinter“ মানে কী?","options":["পেছনে","মাঝখানে","সামনে"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-34-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Katze läuft unter ___ Bett.","options":["der","das","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Lampe hängt über ___ Tisch.","options":["den","die","dem"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Auto steht hinter ___ Haus.","options":["das","den","dem"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich hänge die Jacke an ___ Tür.","options":["die","der","den"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wohin? → Akkusativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Geschenk ist für ___ Mutter.","options":["meinem","meine","meiner"],"answer":1,"explanation":"für → Akkusativ।","id":"a2-practice-34-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt"